            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/68277266c30d261aa6477a2da87696c5.avif?t=1687055115\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>In <strong><i>Trail of the Damned</i></strong> you explore the hellscape known as Damnation, solving mysteries, unlocking secrets, and surviving endless dangers on your quest for Salvation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/1ffd558430ba01718da72d2c3d9fe57a.poster.avif?t=1687055115\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/1ffd558430ba01718da72d2c3d9fe57a.webm?t=1687055115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/1ffd558430ba01718da72d2c3d9fe57a.mp4?t=1687055115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Branching Gameplay!</h2><br>Uncover an unforgiving branching narrative, as you travel in an <i>Oregon Trail</i> style of gameplay, filled with unnerving encounters and unlikely companions. Hideous dangers lurk around every corner and <strong><i>your</i> choices</strong> will determine who you are, where you go, what you do, who you meet, and ultimately <i>how your story ends</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/54ca45764087a1ca72b26bbf5e27e806.poster.avif?t=1687055115\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/54ca45764087a1ca72b26bbf5e27e806.webm?t=1687055115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/54ca45764087a1ca72b26bbf5e27e806.mp4?t=1687055115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounter Disturbing Horrors!</h2><br>The art style is very stark and full of contrast - meant to evoke the feelings of darkness and dread appropriate to such a world of horrors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/6609a433045ab5c6153140866d79dc64.avif?t=1687055115\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Mysteries!</h2><br>The game invites you to explore these horrors at your own pace. Along the way you'll find a land filled with mystery, possibility, and danger. Uncovering and solving certain mysteries will open new locations for exploration.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Seek Salvation, an escape from all that ails, with multiple endings and a variety of challenges along the way.<br></li><li> The choices you make determine who you are. Are you a con artist? A bully? A scavenger? How you navigate the perils Damnation is up to you.<br></li><li> Explore a unique fantasy hellscape inspired by creepy silent horror films and other unnerving works.<br></li><li> Solve puzzles and riddles to unlock mysterious hidden areas.<br></li><li> Your adventures are underscored by an eerie yet exciting string quartet OST inspired by and combining the kinds of instruments one might hear in a silent movie house.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/68277266c30d261aa6477a2da87696c5.avif?t=1687055115\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>In <strong><i>Trail of the Damned</i></strong> you explore the hellscape known as Damnation, solving mysteries, unlocking secrets, and surviving endless dangers on your quest for Salvation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/1ffd558430ba01718da72d2c3d9fe57a.poster.avif?t=1687055115\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/1ffd558430ba01718da72d2c3d9fe57a.webm?t=1687055115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/1ffd558430ba01718da72d2c3d9fe57a.mp4?t=1687055115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Branching Gameplay!</h2><br>Uncover an unforgiving branching narrative, as you travel in an <i>Oregon Trail</i> style of gameplay, filled with unnerving encounters and unlikely companions. Hideous dangers lurk around every corner and <strong><i>your</i> choices</strong> will determine who you are, where you go, what you do, who you meet, and ultimately <i>how your story ends</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/54ca45764087a1ca72b26bbf5e27e806.poster.avif?t=1687055115\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/54ca45764087a1ca72b26bbf5e27e806.webm?t=1687055115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/54ca45764087a1ca72b26bbf5e27e806.mp4?t=1687055115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounter Disturbing Horrors!</h2><br>The art style is very stark and full of contrast - meant to evoke the feelings of darkness and dread appropriate to such a world of horrors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638390/extras/6609a433045ab5c6153140866d79dc64.avif?t=1687055115\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Mysteries!</h2><br>The game invites you to explore these horrors at your own pace. Along the way you'll find a land filled with mystery, possibility, and danger. Uncovering and solving certain mysteries will open new locations for exploration.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Seek Salvation, an escape from all that ails, with multiple endings and a variety of challenges along the way.<br></li><li> The choices you make determine who you are. Are you a con artist? A bully? A scavenger? How you navigate the perils Damnation is up to you.<br></li><li> Explore a unique fantasy hellscape inspired by creepy silent horror films and other unnerving works.<br></li><li> Solve puzzles and riddles to unlock mysterious hidden areas.<br></li><li> Your adventures are underscored by an eerie yet exciting string quartet OST inspired by and combining the kinds of instruments one might hear in a silent movie house.</li></ul>",
